---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const nextUrl = `${Astro.url.origin}/free-deck-planning-checklist-thank-you/`;
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Free DMV Deck Planning Checklist | Maryland DC Virginia"
  description="Get the free DMV Deck Planning Checklist for Maryland, Washington DC, and Virginia. Enter your email to access the printable homeowner checklist."
>
  <div class="lead-page">
    <section class="lead-hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">FREE DMV HOMEOWNER RESOURCE</p>
      <h1>Planning a Deck in Maryland, DC or Virginia?</h1>
      <h2>Start With the Right Information.</h2>
      <p class="lead-copy">Get the free DMV Deck Planning Checklist and organize the information you should have before moving forward with a deck project.</p>
      <a class="primary-button" href="#get-checklist">Get the Free Checklist</a>
    </section>

    <section class="checklist-benefits">
      <div class="benefit-card"><h3>✓ Property & Site Information</h3><p>Organize property details, existing conditions, measurements, access, and site information.</p></div>
      <div class="benefit-card"><h3>✓ Project Goals & Layout</h3><p>Clarify intended use, deck location, size, stairs, railings, features, and priorities.</p></div>
      <div class="benefit-card"><h3>✓ DMV Permit Preparation</h3><p>Prepare for jurisdiction-specific requirements in Maryland, Washington DC, and Virginia, including zoning, permits, drawings, surveys, and HOA documents.</p></div>
      <div class="benefit-card"><h3>✓ Budget & Design Priorities</h3><p>Organize your budget, material preferences, must-have features, and questions before professional design.</p></div>
    </section>

    <section class="jurisdiction-section">
      <p class="eyebrow">BUILT FOR THE DMV</p>
      <h2>Maryland • Washington DC • Virginia</h2>
      <p>The checklist helps homeowners identify the local jurisdiction, gather the right project information, and prepare questions about permits, zoning, setbacks, HOA requirements, drawings, and inspections. Requirements vary by municipality and project, so always verify current requirements with the applicable authority.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="kit-callout">
      <p class="eyebrow">READY TO GO FURTHER?</p>
      <h2>Get the Complete Deck Planning Kit</h2>
      <p>If you want a more detailed homeowner workbook with project-planning worksheets, checklists, and preparation tools, upgrade to the complete Deck Planning Kit for <strong>$49</strong>.</p>
      <a class="primary-button" href="/deck-planning-kit/">Get the Complete Kit — $49</a>
    </section>

    <section class="lead-form-section" id="get-checklist">
      <div class="form-card">
        <p class="eyebrow">FREE DOWNLOAD</p>
        <h2>Enter Your Email to Get the Checklist</h2>
        <p>Your checklist is delivered through the download page after you submit your email.</p>
        <form action="https://formsubmit.co/info@dmvdeckdesigns.com" method="POST">
          <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New DMV Deck Designs Free Checklist Lead" />
          <input type="hidden" name="_next" value={nextUrl} />
          <input type="hidden" name="_captcha" value="false" />
          <input type="hidden" name="_template" value="table" />
          <label for="email">Email Address</label>
          <input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required />
          <button type="submit">Get My Free Checklist</button>
        </form>
        <p class="privacy-note">Your email is used to deliver the checklist and follow up about DMV Deck Designs resources. You can opt out of future messages.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <style>
    .lead-page { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 30px 20px 70px; text-align: center; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; }
    .lead-hero { padding: 70px 20px 55px; }
    .eyebrow { font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    h1, h2, h3 { font-family: Oswald, sans-serif; }
    .lead-hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 6vw, 4.5rem); line-height: 1.05; margin: 0; }
    .lead-hero h2 { font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.4rem); margin: 12px 0 20px; }
    .lead-copy { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto 28px; font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.7; }
    .primary-button, .lead-form-section button { display: inline-block; border: 0; border-radius: 6px; padding: 14px 24px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; font-size: 1rem; }
    .checklist-benefits { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 18px; margin: 10px 0 40px; }
    .benefit-card { padding: 26px; border-radius: 10px; text-align: left; }
    .benefit-card h3 { margin-top: 0; font-size: 1.35rem; }
    .benefit-card p, .jurisdiction-section p, .kit-callout p, .form-card p { line-height: 1.65; }
    .jurisdiction-section { padding: 35px 25px; margin-bottom: 45px; border-radius: 12px; }
    .jurisdiction-section h2 { font-size: 2.1rem; margin: 0 0 12px; }
    .kit-callout { padding: 45px 25px; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 55px; }
    .kit-callout h2 { font-size: 2.1rem; margin: 0 0 10px; }
    .lead-form-section { display: flex; justify-content: center; }
    .form-card { width: min(620px, 100%); padding: 38px 28px; border-radius: 12px; }
    .form-card h2 { font-size: 2rem; margin: 0 0 8px; }
    form { display: grid; gap: 10px; text-align: left; margin-top: 24px; }
    label { font-weight: 700; }
    input { width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #bbb; border-radius: 5px; font-size: 1rem; }
    .privacy-note { font-size: .8rem; margin-top: 14px; }
    @media (max-width: 700px) { .checklist-benefits { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .lead-hero { padding-top: 40px; } }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
